WEBVTT

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.340
He looks really tired.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.700
It cannot be helped.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.180
There was so much activity involving him,

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.230
and many things happened.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.820
That's right.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:57.720
Yuu,

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:03.560
I brought you up from that humble life of yours and made you a maid.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.660
Do you still feel dazed from the change in environment?

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.390
Not at all.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:10.480
I am simply filled with gratitude to you, Milord.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.270
I am just concerned.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.430
Would he ever be able to return to a normal life because of someone...

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.080
You could say I feel sorry for him.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.160
Do you mean Silvia-sama?

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.880
Am I doing the same thing to him as I did to my daughter?

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:31.710
For us, our circumstances have already been decided.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.690
No matter what we choose to become from then on,

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.550
whether or not we can live with that kind of life,

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.820
is something we have to decide for ourselves.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.100
I believe that Master will eventually go along with it.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:46.150
That's not a very good answer.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.310
Forgive me.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:52.880
But, about those whose circumstances have already been decided,

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.550
only they themselves can choose what they wish to make of it.

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:59.320
It's exactly as you say.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.620
Thank you very much.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.610
Whatever Teppei chooses, please watch over him.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:07.990
Yes.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.110
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.990
Ah.  Not at all.

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.820
Oh, I'm sorry about the drool.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:26.130
Do not worry about it.

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:27.140
Please come along.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.350
This...is a house?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.810
I used to use this place when I inherited it.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.460
Now that I don't, it's been neglected for a while.

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.460
Neglected?!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:44.790
Don't worry!

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.230
Yuu, I leave the rest to you.

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:49.140
Get some proper rest, Teppei.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:00.510
Let us go inside then, Master.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:01.990
Master...

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.640
Hold on a minute, what do you mean by 'Master'?!

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:08.780
Forgive me for not saying this earlier.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.410
My name is Fujikura Yuu.

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.030
I am your exclusive maid, Master.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:15.990
Please,

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:16.920
come this way.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.990
All of us are at your service, Master.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.080
All of us humble maids.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.990
All for me?

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.780
Welcome home,

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.080
Master.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:41.590
Um...could you refrain from calling me 'Master'?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.760
Will this not do?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.330
I'm not saying it won't do.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.440
I don't think I can ever get used to being called 'Master'.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.560
How about calling me by name?

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:55.990
Will "Teppei-sama" do, then?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.660
No, get rid of the "-sama" too.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.210
That won't do!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.530
If we address the master of the mansion casually, we are setting a bad example for others!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:04.890
You heard him!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:06.810
Teppei-sama!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.240
What's happening...?

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.120
Whoops, sorry.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:20.760
Don't worry about it.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.010
This is your room.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:26.660
Ouch, it's too bright!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.580
What is this light!?

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.060
I will be in the next room.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.140
So if you have <i>any</i> needs, please call.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.820
Here is the internal phone.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.110
Dial two, and I shall be at your service.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.050
Well then, please relax and rest yourself.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.920
Ah, alright.  Thanks.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.040
Why does this bed have a roof, anyway?

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:34.910
Take this!

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:50.640
Thanks.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:53.830
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:59.790
Well, about Silvia-san being my fiancée and all.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.370
Is that kind of thing...normal?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:04.870
What do you mean by 'this kind of thing'?

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:07.760
Well, fiancées and stuff.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:11.390
Deciding this sorts of thing without any consideration for the person's intentions.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.840
Like, um...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.370
...is this something normal in the world of rich people?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:17.640
I do not know if this is normal or not.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:23.190
I believe Milord thinks highly of both you and Silvia-sama.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.140
But I don't know anything about Silvia-san.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.980
Silvia-sama is a member of a high ranking aristocratic family of the Duchy of Fermische.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.480
She is also very skilled at fencing.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.190
No, not that kind of thing.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.290
I meant her character.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.160
Character?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.160
Is that an important thing?

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.200
Of course!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:43.090
It makes or breaks a wedding!

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:45.710
How can you say that a person's character is unimportant?!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:49.140
When I sparred with her, I felt it.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.840
How should I put it...a sense of sadness.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:57.110
Ah, no.  Forget what I said.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:59.380
It's probably just my imagination.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.180
Can I refuse this kind of thing?

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.070
It is up to you.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.100
Up to me?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:10.380
Decisions based on the circumstances presented to you are your own choice to make.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.960
I feel so restless.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.200
Please get used to it.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.400
I wonder if I can.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.870
I used to go to school with a bike, you know?

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.730
What do you think of going to school on a bike?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.170
That will not do!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.220
What happens if you fall down?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.880
I will not have you put yourself in danger!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:22.280
Hey, I can ride a bike pretty well, you know.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.310
This is a question of probability!

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:29.730
Probability, you say...limousines get in accidents too, you know.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:31.150
No it won't!

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.360
Then, would a motorbike that can't fall work?

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:39.740
With grandfather's resources, I'm sure someone could create something like that.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:42.050
That's possible.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:50.690
This is...a school?

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:53.280
This is the school you will be attending from today on.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.560
Shuuhou Academy.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.650
First, we will go to the principal's room to greet him as transfer students.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.560
The biggest private school in Japan.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:05.540
I didn't expect to actually end up attending school here.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:13.340
It feels like I just came to an amazing place.

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:16.510
It may be slightly overwhelming at first, I think.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.670
But if it is you, you should be able to blend in pretty easily.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.840
What's with that baseless talk...

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:23.710
What is this?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:27.290
The name Arima carries a lot of clout.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:29.050
How do they know I'm Arima?!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:39.620
I don't think I can take this!

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.060
It is not a matter of you getting used to it.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.050
Come, let us move on.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:47.820
Teppei-sama!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.570
Looks like I got away.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.310
This place...

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.200
Don't tell me it's...the cafeteria!?

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.470
Well, why am I not surprised...

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.420
Instead of being called a cafeteria, this place is...

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:22.290
Ouch...

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.250
Seika-sama!

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.760
Are you alright?

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.530
I'm fine.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.760
Hey, you.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.170
Be more careful!

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:32.670
Ah.  I'm sorry.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.150
I was daydreaming.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:35.390
Eh?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.080
Your forehead is all red.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.190
Are you okay?

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.100
Gosh...

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:49.280
Men should at least know how to fall down safely!

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.270
Ah.  That pair is striped.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:55.580
This is Houjouin Seika-sama from the Social Club, and that was a direct warning.

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.820
What happened to your gratitude and manners?

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.330
This pair is pink.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.170
What's with that face, anyway?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.150
It's your fault that you were wandering aimlessly around here.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.080
That's a primly white pair.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.430
Huh?!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.070
Calm down.  Let's leave it at that.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.350
I wasn't paying attention either, so I'm at fault too.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.100
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.460
Can you stand up?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.320
No, I'm fine.

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:22.070
That's a violation of school regulations!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.610
That open collar right there.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:24.820
Oh, is that so?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.530
Personal grooming is important.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:32.120
If you are a student of this school, paying attention to these things is the natural and correct thing to do.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:35.750
But, you've got a brilliant and agreeable collar make.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.600
There is at least some style in this shirt.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.130
What about the belt...

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.350
I see.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.700
Eighty points, I guess.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:50.060
Seika-sama, I have no intention of making fun of your impression of him, but...!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:51.390
But what?

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:56.150
Well, you haven't seen him before, let alone know his background or where he is from, right?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.280
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:13:59.930
Are you a first-year?

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:01.320
No, second year.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.750
I just transferred in today.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.000
I see.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.600
No wonder you don't look familiar.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.050
I am Houjouin Seika.

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.360
Remember that!

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.980
Well, I just transferred today.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.380
How can you not know Seika-sama?!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:19.250
It's fine.  I'm not famous or anything yet.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.040
Until we meet again, Transfer Student-kun.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.390
Sorry about just now.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:31.310
Teppei-sama!

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:35.300
Teppei-sama!  I was looking for you!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.120
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.930
This is the first time I've ever gotten lost in school.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.080
It's great that you are alright.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.360
Well, shall we proceed?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.700
Yes, yes, yes, I have been waiting for you, Arima Teppei-san!

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:55.970
Arima-san, long life to you!

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:58.170
What was that?

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.840
Milord has made a big donation to this school.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.080
I believe that's why.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.860
Big donation...how much was it?

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:07.310
More than ten---

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:09.220
Never mind , I don't think I want to know.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.600
And this is...?

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:15.950
Isn't all of this the same as at that party in the ballroom?

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.960
I am Arima Teppei.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.820
Applause!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.890
What a high-level syllabus.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.660
I wonder if I can actually follow this stuff.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.850
I am honored to stand in your presence.

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.120
I am Mezu Haruhiko.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.470
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.680
Ah, nice to meet you.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.810
Oh!  What a <i>friendly</i> greeting!

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:50.020
Friendly?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:51.550
I met Arima Isshin-sama last July...

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.250
I am Otomura Kenzo's daughter, Atsumi.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:16:00.080
Arima-sama, we have known your father for some time!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.040
It is an honor to see you.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.040
My name is Imai.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:03.730
My father is an attorney.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.430
What are all of you doing?!

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:08.990
I was halfway into greeting him just now!

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:26.270
I sincerely wish that you would remember me!

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:28.830
I am Mezu! Mezu Haruhiko!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.650
Your Number One Companion, engrave my name into your heart!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.700
Number One Companion?  Since when was there any such...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.570
Since just now!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.320
Number One Companion!

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.870
Ah, it resonates beautifully...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.290
Guess who?

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:46.130
I told you!  I'm a brand new transfer student!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.620
No way I'd know who you are...

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:52.480
This feeling...don't tell me it's...

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.360
You are...

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:58.920
You're boring.

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:02.990
If you can't even address me properly once, I don't think it's destiny.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.380
Just kidding!

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.050
I'm Charlotte Hazelrink!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.630
We meet again!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.090
Your Highness!

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:13.050
You remember me!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.630
How could I forget?

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.990
Really, thank you for last time!

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.140
You saved me!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:22.580
No, I'm not sure if I was much use at that time...

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:25.580
I'm so happy!

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:27.780
W-Wait!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.130
Incredible...

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.090
Amazing!

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.040
No...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.110
Don't <i>say</i> that!

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.830
Maria and Father are always so annoying.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.660
It's not like I have accepted him as my fiancée or anything.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.880
But, I must at least go and greet him.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:52.930
Since we study in the same place anyway.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.350
Excuse me.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:02.370
Ah, Silvie!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:03.380
What's going on?

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:04.680
H...

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.690
H...h...

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:07.290
H...h...ho...

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.140
H...h...ho...how <i>vulgar!</i>

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:16.830
Well then, let's spend our lunch break in this position!

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.730
As if we can do such things right now!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.280
Why did I end up like this in the first place?!

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.140
I wonder if I should get off?

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.290
Arima?

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.970
As in, Arima Financial Combine?

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:31.200
You mean the famous owner of that chain and the distinguished family's son?

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.480
Is this the correct interpretation of what you just said?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.320
Yes. That Arima.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.530
<i>What the hell!?</i>

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.010
Why me?!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:46.530
If he's Arima's brat, then we really didn't treat him properly!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.930
<i>Give me back our first meeting!</i>

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:51.400
<i>Furthermore, we're in the same school!</i>

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.320
I'm sorry!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:55.470
Ahem.  Excuse me.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:19:00.450
Anyway, if you think everyone would prostrate themselves in front of Arima's name, you're wrong.

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:03.390
I must properly teach that brat what that means.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:07.330
I, the head of the Society Club, Houjouin Seika!

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.630
Society Club?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.880
Yeah.  If you enter that club, it's easy to make friends.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.590
There are even opportunities to learn about etiquette and courtesy.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:18.730
Huh.  I see.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.640
You know Silvie?

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:27.920
Well, not really an acquaintance.  More like, fiancée.

00:19:28.090 --> 00:19:29.230
Fiancée?!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.520
I...I see...

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:35.410
I think she's a little dazed about it, too.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.770
And then there was that commotion just now.

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:39.310
That commotion just now?

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:43.370
Well, you know, when she saw me push you down,

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.990
come to think of it, I didn't really push you down, but

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:49.200
I guess if you think about it, it doesn't look like anything else except me pushing you down.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.310
Oh, well...

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.720
...then, why don't we go and make up with her?

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.880
I don't understand, but I think you want to get along well with Silvie, right?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:05.170
Eh, where did you get that from?

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.630
Don't worry!  I'll come too!

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:10.720
W-Wait, hold on!

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:12.190
I'm not prepared!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.100
Amazing!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:22.930
It's Silvie!

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.610
Cool, you found her without even seeing her face!

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:26.830
I can see from her stance.

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.880
I saw it when I sparred with her yesterday.

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:33.970
Beautiful...

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.360
Hey, just step forward there!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.250
She's not herself.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.590
She was a lot sharper than that.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:47.730
Sorry.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:56.900
I see.  She's probably lonely.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:01.010
There isn't anyone here that she can go all out against.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:02.880
That's why she's lonely.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:09.110
Then, if you and Silvie go at it with each other, she won't be lonely anymore, right?

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.230
Silvie!

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:13.550
Charlotte.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.180
Arima.

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:15.560
Excuse me.

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.360
Teppei says, "let's fight!"

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:19.590
What?

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:21.380
Eh?  Says who?

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:24.300
He said once we spar then you won't be lonely!

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:26.590
Lonely?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:30.390
Oh, now I'm lonely?

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:31.750
Teppei was like,

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:35.540
"Silvie is so lonely, so lonely, it can't be helped!"

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.130
I never said anything close to that!

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:39.440
Come!

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:41.770
I'll take you on.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.820
Why is this happening...?

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.280
Stop dallying and come!

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:49.350
Alright!

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.580
Let's finish where we left off yesterday!

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:29.230
Question!
How big is Shuuhou Academy anyway?

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:29.990
No idea.

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:32.810
Leave this question to me, Houjouin Seika.

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:35.770
Next time on Princess Lover! Sword and Dance.

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:38.640
The Eastern Tokyo Section is sixty-four hectares,
and the Drumcan is twenty-four hectares.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:39.540
How trivial.
